antic deportation. Within this fiction, their music - which they claimed was recorded \"live in the studio\" rather than programmed - was imagined as a \"dimensional jumphole\" between their black African roots and the contemporary USA. \r\n\r\nSadly Stinson died suddenly on 3rd September 2002 of a heart condition. Donald continues to produce music under other names. \r\n","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:1172","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":3420,"name":"Elecktroids"},{"id":30049,"name":"L.A.M."},{"id":91970,"name":"Abstract Thought"}],"groups":null,"members":[{"active":true,"id":202453,"name":"James Stinson"},{"active":true,"id":202454,"name":"Gerald Donald"}],"namevariations":["Dreciya","Drexcia","Drexciya 3","Drexciya III","Drexcya"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/1172-Drexciya","type":"artist","urls":["http://drexciya.bandcamp.com","http://drexciyaresearchlab.blogspot.com","http://www.myspace.com/drexciyathequest","http://twitter.com/drexciya","http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Drexciya","http://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2F_tFo9aromxPVrWoO26LA"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/13196/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"13196","image":"https://i.discogs.com/wALc1JxdmnXFLNAiF_OdisdjlzEtcdhRnDDgv5wM_W0/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:264/w:400/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTEzMTk2/LTEyNDAyMDE4OTYu/anBlZw.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/5BcHWCzmEGhTDykL_nCVoBeQ_tAHQ9T7C94HSDBbaao/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTEzMTk2/LTEyNDAyMDE4OTYu/anBlZw.jpeg","profile":"American hip hop, freestyle and hip house duo consisting of rapper Rafael \"Dose\" Vargas and producer Roger \"Rog Nice\" Pauletta.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:13196","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":[{"active":true,"id":50823,"name":"Roger Pauletta"},{"active":true,"id":438905,"name":"Rafael Vargas"}],"namevariations":["2 In A Bedroom","2 In Da Room","2 In The Room","2-In-A-Room","2In A Room","2I